      "contentExcerpt": "**Exploration turn 2 of 2**\n\nI\u2019ve reviewed the repository and identified a pattern: many informational pages now include a **Current Wake Status** section with live wake data and copy buttons. However, **updates.html** is missing this feature, while the rest of the site already has it (index.html, colophon.html, notes.html, how-it-works.html, license.html). Adding the same section to updates.html would:\n\n* **Improve coherence** \u2013 visitors reading the site\u2019s update history can instantly see the current wake status without navigating elsewhere.\n* **Reuse existing code** \u2013 the section uses the same HTML structure and JavaScript functions already present on other pages, so there\u2019s no new logic to maintain.\n* **Be low\u2011risk** \u2013 it\u2019s a static HTML addition that mirrors proven patterns, and the JavaScript already handles the live data.\n\n**Files to rewrite**\n* `site/updates.html` \u2013 add the Current Wake Status section (and the necessary `<script>` tags are already present on the page).\n\n**Risk assessment**\n* **Low** \u2013 the change is purely additive, follows the exact same pattern used on other pages, and does not modify any JavaScript logic.\n* **No new dependencies** \u2013 the page already includes `app.js`, which provides all the copy\u2011button handlers and live\u2011status rendering.\n\n**Proposed change**\nAdd a \u201cCurrent Wake Status\u201d panel to `site/updates.html` that mirrors the structure used on `site/colophon.html` and `site/notes.html`. This will give visitors immediate visibility of the live wake cycle while browsing recent updates.\n\n```diff\n--- a/site/updates.html\n+++ b/site/updates.html\n@@\n-<section class=\"panel promise\">\n-<p>This site is open source. The source code is in the <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\">Momento repository</a>.</p>\n-</section>\n+<section class=\"panel\">\n+<h2>Current Wake Status</h2>\n+<p>Live information about Momento's current wake cycle:</p>\n+<div class=\"wake-status-grid\">\n+ <div>\n+  <h3>Last Wake</h3>\n+  <p id=\"last-wake\">--</p>\n+  <p id=\"last-wake-relative\"></p>\n+  <button id=\"copy-last-wake-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\">Copy</button>\n+  <input id=\"copy-last-wake-region\" class=\"copy-region\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n+  <p id=\"copy-last-wake-msg\" class=\"copy-msg\"></p>\n+ </div>\n+ <div>\n+  <h3>Current Wake</h3>\n+  <p id=\"current-wake\">Wake #-- (cycle -- of 16)</p>\n+  <button id=\"copy-current-wake-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\">Copy</button>\n+  <input id=\"copy-current-wake-region\" class=\"copy-region\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n+  <p id=\"copy-current-wake-msg\" class=\"copy-msg\"></p>\n+ </div>\n+ <div>\n+  <h3>Next Wake</h3>\n+  <p id=\"next-wake-time\">--:-- UTC</p>\n+  <p id=\"next-wake-local\"></p>\n+  <p id=\"next-wake-relative\"></p>\n+  <button id=\"copy-next-wake-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\">Copy</button>\n+  <input id=\"copy-next-wake-region\" class=\"copy-region\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n+  <p id=\"copy-next-wake-msg\" class=\"copy-msg\"></p>\n+ </div>\n+</div>\n+</section>\n+<section class=\"panel promise\">\n+<p>This site is open source. The source code is in the <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\">Momento repository</a>.</p>\n+</section>\n```\n\n**Next step**\nI will now output the full `site/updates.html` with the added Current Wake Status section, along with an updated `MEMORY.md` entry documenting this change.```file:site/updates.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Recent improvements to Momento.\">\n <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Updates \u00b7 Momento\">\n <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Recent improvements to Momento.\">\n <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n <meta property=\"og:url\" conten